<view class="page"><view class="title">本轮审核与领取</view><view class="intro">固定本轮输出，逐项保留审核。合格项可独立领取，打包只包括清单明确列出的已批准成片。</view><view class="status">{{status}}</view><view class="card" wx:if="{{view}}"><view class="card-title">{{view.batch_name}}</view><view class="small">本轮 {{view.created_at}} · 共 {{view.total}} 项</view><button class="secondary" bindtap="refresh" disabled="{{busy}}">刷新状态</button><picker range="{{filters}}" value="{{filterIndex}}" bindchange="filterChange" disabled="{{busy || pending || otherPending}}"><view class="picker">{{filters[filterIndex]}} ▾</view></picker></view>
 <view class="card" wx:if="{{pending}}"><view>原审核或打包提交尚待核对，请沿用原键和正文。</view><button bindtap="recover" disabled="{{busy}}">核对原提交</button><button bindtap="recover" data-repeat="true" disabled="{{busy}}">继续原提交</button></view><view class="card" wx:if="{{otherPending}}">请先在原制作或任务页面核对尚未确认的操作。</view>
 <view class="card" wx:if="{{view}}"><view class="row"><button class="secondary" bindtap="choose" data-mode="all" disabled="{{busy || pending || otherPending}}">选择当前筛选项</button><button class="secondary" bindtap="choose" data-mode="none" disabled="{{busy || pending || otherPending}}">清空选择</button></view><button bindtap="prepareReview" disabled="{{busy || pending || otherPending || !selected.length}}">核对所选审核</button><button bindtap="previewDelivery" disabled="{{busy || pending || otherPending || !selected.length}}">预览交付清单</button><button bindtap="saveSelected" disabled="{{busy || pending || otherPending || !selected.length}}">逐项保存已批准成片</button></view>
 <view class="card" wx:for="{{rows}}" wx:key="key"><view class="row"><button class="small-button" bindtap="select" data-key="{{item.key}}" disabled="{{busy || pending || otherPending}}">{{item.selected ? '☑' : '☐'}}</button><view class="card-title">{{item.name}}</view></view><view>v{{item.revision_number}} · {{item.label}}</view><view class="small">{{item.work.reason}}</view><button class="secondary" bindtap="openWork" data-key="{{item.key}}" disabled="{{busy || !item.artifact_id}}">查看成片 / 审核</button></view>
 <view class="card" wx:if="{{prepared}}"><view class="card-title">核对所列 {{targetCount}} 份输出的审核</view><view class="small">所选 {{prepared.items.length}} 项，当前可提交 {{targetCount}} 项，其余项没有可用审核输出。</view><view wx:for="{{prepared.items}}" wx:key="key">{{item.name}} · v{{item.revision_number}}<view class="small">{{item.report.latest.note}}</view></view><picker range="{{decisions}}" value="{{decisionIndex}}" bindchange="decisionChange" disabled="{{busy || pending || otherPending}}"><view class="picker">{{decisions[decisionIndex]}} ▾</view></picker><textarea value="{{note}}" maxlength="4000" bindinput="noteInput" placeholder="共同意见；退回时必填" disabled="{{busy || pending || otherPending}}"/><view class="small">批准前请检查画面、声音和字幕，状态变化项由服务器跳过。</view><button class="primary" bindtap="submitReview" disabled="{{busy || pending || otherPending || !targetCount}}">{{decisionIndex === 0 ? '批准' : '退回'}}所列 {{targetCount}} 份输出</button></view>
 <view class="card"><view>交付包包含当前版 SRT / VTT（有字幕时）<switch checked="{{subtitles}}" bindchange="subtitleChange" disabled="{{busy || pending || otherPending}}"/></view></view>
 <view class="card" wx:if="{{preview}}"><view class="card-title">交付清单：纳入 {{preview.manifest.included_count}} 项，排除 {{preview.manifest.excluded_count}} 项</view><view>视频合计 {{videoSize}}</view><view class="small">{{preview.configuration.note}}</view><view class="card" wx:for="{{preview.manifest.items}}" wx:key="key"><view>{{item.name}} · v{{item.revision_number}} · {{item.included ? '纳入已批准成片' : '排除'}}</view><view class="small">{{item.reason}} {{item.subtitle_note}}</view></view><view class="error">{{previewReasons}}</view><button class="secondary" bindtap="exportManifest" disabled="{{busy}}">导出这份清单</button><button class="primary" bindtap="createPackage" disabled="{{busy || pending || otherPending || !preview.can_package}}">仅打包所列 {{preview.manifest.included_count}} 项</button></view>
 <view class="card-title">本轮交付包</view><view class="card" wx:for="{{packages}}" wx:key="id"><view>{{item.created_at}} · {{item.label}}</view><view>纳入 {{item.included_count}} 项 / 排除 {{item.excluded_count}} 项</view><view class="small">{{item.why}}</view><button bindtap="packageAccess" data-id="{{item.id}}" disabled="{{busy || pending || otherPending || item.status !== 'succeeded'}}">核对并导出 ZIP</button><button bindtap="packageAccess" data-id="{{item.id}}" data-copy="true" disabled="{{busy || pending || otherPending || item.status !== 'succeeded'}}">复制临时 ZIP 领取链接</button><button class="secondary" bindtap="openJob" data-job="{{item.job_id}}" disabled="{{busy}}">原打包任务 / 恢复</button></view><button wx:if="{{more}}" bindtap="more" disabled="{{busy}}">更多交付包</button></view>
